## Folder map

Where everything lives. The folders mirror the org — one area, one home.

```
[venture]/
├── CLAUDE.md              ← this file — root context, read first
├── OKRS.md               ← the three goals + current standing (derived)
├── CONTROL_CENTRE.md     ← single 30-second scan of where things are
├── SOURCES_OF_TRUTH.md   ← which file owns which fact + precedence ladder
├── INGESTION_GATE.md     ← the gate on everything new (fact/validate/disregard)
├── SCHEDULE.md           ← what routines fire, when, on which machine
├── _routines/            ← the routine prompts + their run logs (runs/)
├── _crm/                 ← people: customers, investors, advisors, to-meet
├── _memory/              ← patterns/lessons, brain-health logs, the extraction queue
├── research/             ← deep dives + a RESEARCH_TRACKER.md index
├── decisions/            ← DECISIONS.md (what was decided + why)
└── tools/                ← dashboard.py + any scripts
```

Adjust to fit your org — but keep the rule: **one area, one folder; one fact, one owner.**

